            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 4,
            "SpeakerName": "工作人员1",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "……喂，您好……诶！？真的吗！？/n那到达时间……诶诶诶！？来不了！？",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410030",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441005,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 5,
            "SpeakerName": "工作人员1",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "知、知道了！我马上确认！/n……那个！制作人！",
            "BgmFileName": "999",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410040",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441006,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 6,
            "SpeakerName": "制作人",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "怎么了，出什么问题了吗？",
            "BgmFileName": "29",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410050",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441007,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 7,
            "SpeakerName": "工作人员1",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "是这样的……。/n原定今天参加拍摄的模特莉莎小姐……。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410060",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441008,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 8,
            "SpeakerName": "工作人员1",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "她原本计划结束海外外景后，搭一早的飞机回来……/n结果因为天气恶劣，航班好像全部取消了……。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410070",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441009,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 9,
            "SpeakerName": "工作人员1",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "恐怕赶不上拍摄……。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410080",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441010,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 10,
            "SpeakerName": "制作人",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "什……什么！？喂喂，那怎么办！/n主模特不在，根本没法拍啊！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410090",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441011,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 11,
            "SpeakerName": "工作人员1",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "是、是没错……。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410100",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441012,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 12,
            "SpeakerName": "工作人员2",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "不是吧，怎么办……。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410110",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441013,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 13,
            "SpeakerName": "工作人员3",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "化妆组也都准备万全，看来今天只能撤了。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410120",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441014,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 14,
            "SpeakerName": "王雪",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "（嗯？怎么了？出什么事了吗？/n　……该不会连餐饮也要取消吧）",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410130",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 6,
                    "SpineId": 30306,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "303"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441015,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 15,
            "SpeakerName": "王雪",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "（大家从早上一起忙着做出来的啊……！/n　我不知道发生了什么，但至少这些一定要吃掉啊……！）",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410140",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 74,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
                    "SpineId": 30306,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "303"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441016,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 16,
            "SpeakerName": "王雪",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "（算了。如果真出了问题，之后应该会有人来指示。/n　在那之前，我先做好自己的工作）",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410150",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 15,
                    "SpineId": 30306,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "303"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441017,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 17,
            "SpeakerName": "制作人",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "哈啊……只要能找到替补就能解决……。/n需要一个能穿好这件礼服、身材娇小又灵活的模特……。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410160",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441018,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 18,
            "SpeakerName": "王雪",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "（空着的桌子上摆上花瓶……接下来……）",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410170",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
                    "SpineId": 30306,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "303"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441019,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 19,
            "SpeakerName": "制作人",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "嗯？",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410180",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441020,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 20,
            "SpeakerName": "制作人",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "（那个孩子是怎么回事……。/n　明明穿着婚礼会场工作人员的制服，动作却这么轻巧……）",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410190",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441021,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 21,
            "SpeakerName": "制作人",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "（而且身材纤细娇小，和莉莎的体型也很接近……）",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410200",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441022,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 22,
            "SpeakerName": "制作人",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "（再加上外貌也很出众……话说，是不是在哪见过这张脸？/n　好像在哪个剧团采访里见过……）",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410210",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441023,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 23,
            "SpeakerName": "制作人",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "喂。/n那个孩子……那个会场工作人员叫什么？",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410220",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441024,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 24,
            "SpeakerName": "工作人员1",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "诶？这个，我也不太清楚……。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410230",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441025,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 25,
            "SpeakerName": "制作人",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "那边那个……正在往桌上摆花瓶、头发颜色很亮的女孩！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410240",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441026,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 26,
            "SpeakerName": "王雪",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "？摆花瓶的……是说我吗？/n……您好，请问有什么事。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410250",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
                    "SpineId": 30306,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "303"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441027,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 27,
            "SpeakerName": "制作人",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "你能不能站到那里去一下？/n就是摄像机摆着的……对，就那里！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410260",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441028,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 28,
            "SpeakerName": "王雪",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "（是想确认模特站位吗？/n　真是的……这种事叫拍摄工作人员来做不就好了……）",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410270",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 74,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
                    "SpineId": 30306,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "303"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441029,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 29,
            "SpeakerName": "王雪",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "呃……站这里对吗？",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410280",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
                    "SpineId": 30306,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "303"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441030,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 30,
            "SpeakerName": "制作人",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "对对！……工作人员！大家都过来！",
            "BgmFileName": "201",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410290",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441031,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 31,
            "SpeakerName": "王雪",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "（！？什么！？这次又在闹什么……！？）",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410300",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 500,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
                    "SpineId": 30306,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "303"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441032,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 32,
            "SpeakerName": "制作人",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "怎么样，大家？不觉得她很适合当替补吗？",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410310",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441033,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 33,
            "SpeakerName": "工作人员1",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "哇……不错啊……！/n也很符合这次拍摄的整体形象！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410320",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441034,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 34,
            "SpeakerName": "工作人员2",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "嗯。体型看起来也正合适，/n只要本人愿意，我觉得可以。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410330",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441035,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 35,
            "SpeakerName": "工作人员3",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "化完妆一定会更上镜。一下有干劲了。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410340",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441036,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 36,
            "SpeakerName": "制作人",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "……事情就是这样。/n虽然很突然，能请你作为替补担任模特吗？",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410350",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441037,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 37,
            "SpeakerName": "制作人",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "会场负责人那边，我来说明！/n报酬也会照付！所以……拜托了！求你了！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410360",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441038,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 38,
            "SpeakerName": "王雪",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "什、什么……！？",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410370",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 500,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 5,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 3,
                    "SpineId": 30306,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "303"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441039,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 39,
            "SpeakerName": "制作人",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "你会困惑也很正常！/n但是……现在真的只剩你能帮我们了！拜托！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410380",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441040,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 40,
            "SpeakerName": "工作人员们",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "拜托了！！！！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410390",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441041,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 41,
            "SpeakerName": "王雪",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "唔……。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410400",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 25,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
                    "SpineId": 30306,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "303"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441042,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 42,
            "SpeakerName": "王雪",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "（还有报酬……。照理说我很想马上答应……/n　可不经过剧团就接拍摄工作，果然还是不太妙吧……）",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410410",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
                    "SpineId": 30306,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "303"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441043,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 43,
            "SpeakerName": "王雪",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "那个，我所属银河座……/n杂志工作不是我一个人能擅自决定的……。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410420",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
                    "SpineId": 30306,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "303"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441044,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 44,
            "SpeakerName": "制作人",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "嗯，果然如此！难怪我觉得眼熟……/n不过原来是银河座吗……嗯，原来如此。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410430",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441045,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 45,
            "SpeakerName": "工作人员1",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "怎么办，制作人……？",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410440",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142441046,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142441,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 46,
            "SpeakerName": "制作人",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "……你叫什么名字？",
            "VoiceFileName": "1424410450",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
